    "_comment": "2026-08-10 (integ/data absorbing founder ruling oyatie-0s8 unit): expected_total 96 -> 97 AND expected_live_v1_total 58 -> 59. BOTH counts move by the SAME +1 because data/manifest.json declares canonical schema_version 1.0 with a contracts object and therefore lands in the live-v1 corpus as well as the governed universe. ONE capability-root manifest is ADDED and named: data/manifest.json (ADR-0562 capability OWN service manifest). The collection rule, governed roots, and tests/ skip are unchanged — same walk over the previous tree still yields 96. Sibling capability roots (cell/comms/data/iam/workflow minus this one) land via their own integ PRs. PRIOR ENTRY retained — 2026-08-08 (PR #1620): 97 -> 96, walk began skipping tests/ fixtures (cell/core/regional-pack/tests/fixtures/kr/manifest.json)."
  },
